            "fieldType": "summary",
            "type": "SET",
            "value": "1. Zonal & Module SW Updates"
          },
          {
            "field": {
              "type": "ID",
              "value": "description"
            },
            "fieldType": "description",
            "type": "SET",
            "value": "Update the following modules to [LATEST BUILD]:\nZonals: Chargeport (CPZM), Front Left (FLZM), Front Right (FRZM).\n\nEPAS - does not require an update but needs to be enabled.\nEBB- update the bootloader to 1.0.0 then the software to 6.0.3.  Ensure the calibration file is correct for the vehicle type (AWD/RWD).\n\nThe HPCC components:\nIVI\nRTD\nTDA4\n- configure the Marvell switch with EV1_5151_v25_32.bin\n\nTCU - update to VU5t-14J314-AAA00231/4.0.0.231"
          },
